If your app works in general, and only crashes unpredictably/randomly, this usually points to a memory issue. You can configure your application with more memory and see if that makes a difference. Please refer to the guide <https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps/blob/master/guide/guide.md>, section called "Configuring Shiny Applications" for instructions.

Also, for shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> specific questions and issues, you might also also want to post them here:

https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/shinyapps-users

Best,
Fereshteh

